data: {"id": "c39718c309d5458d-thinking-parallel_evidence-287", "run_id": "c39718c309d5458d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的事实如下：\n\n1.  **当前状态**：Pod `workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` 处于 **CrashLoopBackOff** 状态，未恢复。\n2.  **重启趋势**：`kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 显示重启次数达到 **8 次**，重启趋势持续增长，表明崩溃持续发生。\n3.  **崩溃原因**：`kubectl_previous_logs` 捕获到容器退出前的报错日志，内容为 `CONFIG_MISSING` 和 `http_status: 500`，指向应用缺少关键配置导致启动/运行失败。\n\n目前证据链已闭合，根因指向“应用配置缺失（CONFIG_MISSING）”。", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789073277872, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c39718c309d5458d-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "c39718c309d5458d", "seq": 288, "ts_ms": 1789073287225, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 51.265, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-07", "name": "workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c39718c309d5458d-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "fd136aa95248fdc51b3c60c5c8fc3eafc2805cf1de178ed2db56e98e1551ffeb", "bytes": 2450}, "snapshot_sha256": "90609f5560950cc8da76a7b897505db18581a9b2f832646ccc336a3de92884a2"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

