ing_exit` 与日志模式直接对应，证实了退出是由应用逻辑触发的，而非 OOM 或系统级崩溃。Metrics 的 restart 趋势图验证了该循环持续发生了至少 7-8 次。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n应用启动初始化 → 检测到关键配置缺失 (CONFIG_MISSING) → 触发业务逻辑终止 (exit_code: 78, HTTP 500) → 容器崩溃并触发 K8s 回退重启 (CrashLoopBackOff)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为**应用启动时依赖的关键配置项缺失**。\n应用进程在初始化阶段检测到配置缺失（通过日志 `message: CONFIG_MISSING` 和 Tracing `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` 确认），主动以退出码 78 终止进程并返回 HTTP 500 状态码。这种非零退出触发了 Kubernetes 的重启机制，导致 `CrashLoopBackOff` 现象持续发生。缺少该关键配置是造成应用无法启动并持续崩溃的直接原因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 51.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 51.3s (Evidence 42.0s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 84.348, "metrics": {"run_id": "c39718c309d5458d", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 84.35422325134277, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "